{"message": {"content": [{"content": "Web search results for query: \"Claude Code changelog latest version\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"# How to Check and Update Your Claude Code Version\",\"url\":\"https://www.fast.io/resources/claude-code-version-changelog-guide.md\"},{\"title\":\"AI & Agents\",\"url\":\"https://fast.io/resources/claude-code-version-changelog-guide/\"},{\"title\":\"Claude FastClaude Fast\",\"url\":\"https://claudefa.st/blog/guide/changelog\"},{\"title\":\"Claude FastClaude Fast\",\"url\":\"https://claudefa.st/docs/learn/changelog\"},{\"title\":\"claude code changelog\",\"url\":\"https://www.claudelog.com/claude-code-changelog/\"},{\"title\":\"version check\",\"url\":\"https://tessl.io/registry/skills/github/ykdojo/claude-code-tips/version-check\"},{\"title\":\"Claude Code Changelog & Release Notes\",\"url\":\"https://www.havoptic.com/tools/claude-code\"},{\"title\":\"www.issoh.co.jp\",\"url\":\"https://www.issoh.co.jp/md/tech/10625\"},{\"title\":\"claude code release notes\",\"url\":\"https://claudelog.com/faqs/claude-code-release-notes\"}]\n\nThe most recent version I found is **v2.1.263**, listed on claudelog.com with a date of September 5, 2026. Its entry describes bug fixes and reliability improvements. The same page also notes that --append-subagent-system-prompt-file reads a subagent system prompt from a file.\n\nOther sources are older. A Japanese tech blog shows output from August 30, 2026 reporting Claude Code is up to date (2.1.251). Havoptic lists v2.1.207 as the latest as of July 10, 2026. Fast.io's guide covers releases through v2.1.195 in late June 2026.\n\nThese sources are third-party trackers, and their dates don't fully agree. Since today is October 21, 2026, v2.1.263 may not be the newest build. The official changelog at code.claude.com/docs/en/changelog, or the GitHub releases page at github.com/anthropics/claude-code/releases, is the authoritative source to confirm the current version. Running `claude` with its update command, or checking the installed version, will also show the exact build.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your ", "tool_use_id": "toolu_01MWUYDdHiWGTGetAh2q745h", "type": "tool_result"}], "role": "user"}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "session_id": "67eb37fe-d3ec-4908-843f-0ddd25238fff", "timestamp": "2026-10-21T12:58:27.706Z", "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_01MWUYDdHiWGTGetAh2q745h", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "reason_type": "rule", "source": "config"}}], "tool_use_result": {"durationSeconds": 5.5178040909999995, "query": "Claude Code changelog latest version", "results": [{"content": [{"title": "# How to Check and Update Your Claude Code Version", "url": "https://www.fast.io/resources/claude-code-version-changelog-guide.md"}, {"title": "AI & Agents", "url": "https://fast.io/resources/claude-code-version-changelog-guide/"}, {"title": "Claude FastClaude Fast", "url": "https://claudefa.st/blog/guide/changelog"}, {"title": "Claude FastClaude Fast", "url": "https://claudefa.st/docs/learn/changelog"}, {"title": "claude code changelog", "url": "https://www.claudelog.com/claude-code-changelog/"}, {"title": "version check", "url": "https://tessl.io/registry/skills/github/ykdojo/claude-code-tips/version-check"}, {"title": "Claude Code Changelog & Release Notes", "url": "https://www.havoptic.com/tools/claude-code"}, {"title": "www.issoh.co.jp", "url": "https://www.issoh.co.jp/md/tech/10625"}, {"title": "claude code release notes", "url": "https://claudelog.com/faqs/claude-code-release-notes"}], "tool_use_id": "srvtoolu_01KZxqM5HmFWBFmqTmDGck7P"}, "The most recent version I found is **v2.1.263**, listed on claudelog.com with a date of September 5, 2026. Its entry describes bug fixes and reliability improvements. The same page also notes that --append-subagent-system-prompt-file reads a subagent system prompt from a file.\n\nOther sources are older. A Japanese tech blog shows output from August 30, 2026 reporting Claude Code is up to date (2.1.251). Havoptic lists v2.1.207 as the latest as of July 10, 2026. Fast.io's guide covers releases through v2.1.195 in late June 2026.\n\nThese sources are third-party trackers, and their dates don't fully agree. Since today is October 21, 2026, v2.1.263 may not be the newest build. The official changelog at code.claude.com/docs/en/changelog, or the GitHub releases page at github.com/anthropics/claude-code/releases, is the authoritative source to confirm the current version. Running `claude` with its update command, or checking the installed version, will also show the exact build."], "searchCount": 1}, "type": "user", "uuid": "eabb456d-c63f-4f6a-8c52-fbfafc4ddbf8"}
